  "Stop trying to score worldies.",
  "Harry Kane scores the easy ones. Again and again.",
  "Here's what I took from watching him.",
  "One. Every cross, every shot from a teammate, he's between the two posts.",
  "That's where the rebounds and tap-ins land.",
  "Two. His body is always half-turned towards goal.",
  "So one touch, and he's already shooting.",
  "Three. First time from the wing? He doesn't add power.",
  "He just points the ball at the goal.",
  "Four. When he does shoot hard, it goes in the corner.",
  "In training, the only thing he cares about is hitting the target.",
  "Easy goals still count.",
  "So next game, stop waiting for the worldie. Get between the posts.",
  "Follow for the next one. The free analysis test is in my bio."
